# The repository root ignores *.log, which is right for build output and wrong
# for these: every .log in this directory is a REAL Gitea Actions job log, and
# it is the test corpus rather than a by-product. Without this re-inclusion,
# `git add -A` skips them silently, the tests pass locally because the files
# are on disk, and CI fails on a fixture nobody can see is missing — which is
# exactly how they were left untracked the first time (PR #909).
!*.log
